<i>If there's a light illuminating the path of the traveler</i>
I won't let go of your students, no matter what.

00:14:21.625 --> 00:14:30.917
<i>If there's a light illuminating the path of the traveler</i>

00:14:30.917 --> 00:14:31.000
<i>If there's a light illuminating the path of the traveler</i>
The tentacles asked me what I wanted to be.

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:32.875
