<i>I am the waiting moon</i>

00:15:09.875 --> 00:15:16.417
<i>You found for me the loneliness</i>
<i>  </i>

00:15:16.417 --> 00:15:19.542
<i>Within hesitation</i>
<i>  </i>

00:15:19.542 --> 00:15:22.583
<i>Within hesitation</i>
That's my story.

00:15:22.583 --> 00:15:25.292
<i>Within hesitation</i>
The one who taught me to be a teacher

00:15:25.292 --> 00:15:29.208
<i>Within hesitation</i>
was Miss Aguri Yukimura.

00:15:29.208 --> 00:15:30.917
To truly <i>look </i>at the people before you

00:15:30.917 --> 00:15:31.375
<i>An unexpected tear</i>
To truly <i>look </i>at the people before you

00:15:31.375 --> 00:15:34.042
<i>An unexpected tear</i>
and respect them as equal human beings,

00:15:34.042 --> 00:15:35.458
<i>An unexpected tear</i>
not to judge them solely on their weaknesses...

00:15:35.458 --> 00:15:38.208
<i>Spills from my eye</i>
